# Design docs / archives (local-only) — historically gitignored to keep
# private design notes out of the public repo. Specific docs that ARE
# meant to be tracked are re-included below.
#
# Git negation rule: a file inside an ignored directory CAN'T be
# re-included by a single `!path` — git never recurses into the
# directory. To unignore one file we have to unignore the directory
# itself first, then re-ignore everything in it, then unignore the
# specific file.
docs/
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/harness-p0-p3-tasks.md

